{"overview":"در سال ۱۹۶۰، هفت کودک حاشیه‌نشین به نام «کلاب بازندگان» با موجودی کهن و تغییر شکل‌پذیر که خود را دلقکی قاتل کودکان جلوه می‌دهد، مبارزه می‌کنند؛ در کنار این، با زورگویی‌ها و والدین ستمگر نیز دست و پنجه نرم می‌کنند. سی سال بعد، برای متوقف کردن این موجود که به شهرشان بازگشته، دوباره گرد هم می‌آیند.","tagline":"","overview_en":"In 1960, seven outcast kids known as \"The Losers' Club\" fight against an ancient shape-shifting alien who poses as a child-killing clown, while also dealing with bullies and abusive parents. Thirty years later, they reunite to stop the creature once and for all when it returns to their hometown.","tagline_en":"The Master of Horror unleashes everything you were ever afraid of.","runtime":90,"status":"Ended","seasons":[{"n":1,"name":"فصل 1","ep":2,"y":1990,"poster":"/qqIiCr0NeHHIKN2bk4tVAZF71fQ.jpg"}],"episodes":2,"crew":["استیون کینگ"],"crew_en":["Stephen King"],"countries":["US"],"cast":[{"name":"تیم کوری","role":"Pennywise","photo":"/8ZsGg3N3OZgxshqLOtA2kl5ckOP.jpg","en":"Tim Curry"},{"name":"Harry Anderson","role":"Richie Tozier","photo":"/sXBQhSzhq04by15j9bH8793cjIg.jpg"},{"name":"دنیس کریستوفر","role":"Eddie Kaspbrak","photo":"/bZMnSpQ6KEBuwUfnngNEpmqhEK.jpg","en":"Dennis Christopher"},{"name":"Richard Masur","role":"Stan Uris","photo":"/yRJCKYoW16HaDEXy37ORnBFBOg7.jpg"},{"name":"Annette O'Toole","role":"Beverly Marsh","photo":"/mCTEEzuNXlCdyl9uM4ot688IfVz.jpg"},{"name":"Tim Reid","role":"Mike Hanlon","photo":"/zUqFVuSPBK09YVvCIxKkAOtoM8m.jpg"},{"name":"John Ritter","role":"Ben Hanscom","photo":"/opfNiumC8LjFoUwaOKrDGuNbIPM.jpg"},{"name":"Richard Thomas","role":"Bill Denbrough","photo":"/fXFFkwrfbo9uAI5H9RoMtg8kerV.jpg"},{"name":"جاناتان برندیس","role":"Bill Denbrough - Age 12","photo":"/fjUTC2SoSImb7qkJ5JUl0aQZDiK.jpg","en":"Jonathan Brandis"},{"name":"Brandon Crane","role":"Ben Hanscom - Age 12","photo":"/yq0u6rVADruGtndJ8fgid8KY0nL.jpg"},{"name":"Adam Faraizl","role":"Eddie Kaspbrak - Age 12","photo":"/Ep1aglu6I5cBZDJJ3iCqUN